---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="NO BALL GAMES Projects | Grime Art, Painted Clothing, XRP KIDs and Collaborations"
  description="Active project lanes for NO BALL GAMES: original Grime Art paintings, hand-painted wearable clothing, brand collaborations and the XRP KIDs lore universe."
  current="projects"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Projects</span>
    <h1>Five active lanes. One street-rooted brand.</h1>
    <p>
      NO BALL GAMES runs across original painted art, wearable clothing, brand collaborations, the XRP KIDs lore universe and a growing collector base. Each lane is active, each one carries the same Grime Art energy and sign-flip identity.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section project-grid">
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Lane 01</span>
      <h3>Grime Art / original painted works</h3>
      <p>Original canvases, pop-culture portraits, sign-flip pieces, mixed-media experiments and raw studio output powered by Charlie Buster's Grime Art visual language. Graffiti texture, estate attitude and one-of-one finish. Each piece is a collectible, not a print run.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}collections/`}>View art collector lane →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Lane 02</span>
      <h3>Painted jackets &amp; wearable art</h3>
      <p>Hand-painted military jackets, denim and custom garments built as one-of-one or limited-run wearable pieces. Each jacket is a canvas in its own right: Grime Art energy on a real garment base, worn as much as displayed. Commission routes are open.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}contact/`}>Order painted clothing →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Lane 03</span>
      <h3>Brand collaborations &amp; Grime Art activations</h3>
      <p>Campaign visuals, creative direction, live-painting events and culture-first collaborations that fit the NO BALL GAMES world. Charlie Buster's Grime Art style brings a raw, distinctly British visual energy to brand activation — anti-corporate, anti-polished, genuinely street-rooted.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}contact/`}>Enquire about collaboration →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Lane 04</span>
      <h3>XRP KIDs universe</h3>
      <p>The XRP-side NO BALL GAMES lore universe. 100 genesis XRP KIDs, Alpha Aaron's machine-control arc, FRET's grassroots resistance, the $PMSL hard-fork shield and Block Buster OG as the hidden 1/1 memory archive. The lore is deep, British, cinematic and built to expand into digital collectibles, character drops and collector-linked mechanics.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}xrp/`}>Explore the XRP KIDs universe →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Lane 05</span>
      <h3>Community &amp; collector drops</h3>
      <p>Physical and digital releases, limited drops, collector passes and community participation lanes. NO BALL GAMES builds for collectors who want the story alongside the object — provenance, lore, Grime Art energy and proof it was made by human hands.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}community/`}>Join the movement →</a>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section split-grid">
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">Who these lanes are for</span>
      <h2>Collectors, artists, collaborators.</h2>
      <ul class="list-clean">
        <li><strong>Collectors:</strong> original paintings, wearable art and digital collectibles.</li>
        <li><strong>Artists:</strong> co-creation lanes and collaboration proposals.</li>
        <li><strong>Brand partners:</strong> Grime Art activation and cultural campaign work.</li>
        <li><strong>Lore fans:</strong> XRP KIDs universe, character pages and community participation.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">Get started</span>
      <h2>Commission, collect or collaborate.</h2>
      <ul class="list-clean">
        <li>Commission an original Grime Art canvas or portrait.</li>
        <li>Order a hand-painted jacket or wearable piece.</li>
        <li>Propose a brand collaboration or creative activation.</li>
        <li>Explore XRP KIDs lore and collector routes.</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}contact/`}>Contact the right lane →</a>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
